ow] [short pause] \"the brightest bloom always hides the deepest.\" [soft] \"and the light...\" [short pause] [soft and mysterious] \"though pure...\" [short pause] \"cannot exist without the shadow within.” [mysterious, low, and fading]  Thank you for your consideration!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@FuteiAnser/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3645883, "client_id": 3265673, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/62bd80a0-4987-49a0-9033-a0e0ad14b1a4?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1779196672&Signature=Mf1~AxhgYdwsR8WFbwCvlX3chzIV5ZbgIgmlW0RwJ6JkWuBUWtJBa9vMRWxGQefPxGIM7SaX3j2AYvur1cUevPFXUt3kcBLaEtNv-Y5Gc5vFt98-hAQovRW19o2igk0vPbewKta6V9kkYK23eh86MPYHebFoo-Y0esefqQJdV2bOMydPpFkxhcAoyba4JxEKp12YQ7iAxNCOyMTryFm4OGVfMqohD4HpO4hJue2E5FDo9DSuw4orTCv5EYFaaLFgADNT7N~AGBlMfMnAFrvM-W5NPfuVRBdXV41XgXY4813KOLNz8mwQ-3Fn5pQ6owExAKjb0Fj6BKFMBPXO2-FW9w__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2031913944903008258%2Fg5JwhpRg.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef1b0a0a538255de83ea9a73224e8b21", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2031913944903008258%2Fg5JwhpRg.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef1b0a0a538255de83ea9a73224e8b21, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2031913944903008258%2Fg5JwhpRg.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4e28b405d68f542e9939dda20977c43 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F2031913944903008258%2Fg5JwhpRg.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef987a2ddcfcebf725b3e3057015b33e 3x"},